OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain clearing east
OL,6,Fthrough the morning. Turning drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter with plenty of autumnal
OL,8,Fsunshine by the afternoon. While the
OL,9,Fodd shower cannot be ruled out, most
OL,10,Fplaces will be dry. Winds also easing
OL,11,Fa little, but staying breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying rather breezy
OL,14,Fovernight with clear spells and
OL,15,Fvariable amounts of cloud. While cloud
OL,16,Fcould thicken a little towards dawn,
OL,17,Fall parts are expected to stay dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
