OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FSome thicker cloud at
OL,6,Ffirst, however this will gradually
OL,7,Fbreak through the day with brighter or
OL,8,Fsunny spells developing. Staying dry,
OL,9,Fwith winds easing further. Staying
OL,10,Frather mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FSettled with variable cloud and sunny
OL,14,Fspells, and temperatures near normal.
OL,15,FOvernight mist and fog patches are
OL,16,Flikely and could be slow to clear.
OL,17,FWinds becoming light and variable.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
